## Notes / deviations from the spec

- **Captured fighter hostility**: when a boss holding a captive is shot in formation, the captive is destroyed with an explosion rather than becoming a separately flying hostile fighter.
- **Dual-fighter firing**: with a dual fighter you may have up to 4 shots on screen (2 per half); the "at most 2" rule applies to a single fighter.
- **Tractor beam capture**: a boss already holding a captive will not capture a second ship (arcade behavior varies); capturing half of a dual fighter costs one reserve ship.
- **Boss first hit**: awarding points happens only on destruction (150/400/800/1600 as specified); the first hit just recolors the boss and plays a distinct sound.
- Entry/dive/challenge paths are approximated with quadratic Bézier swoops rather than the exact arcade path tables.
